docs {
  # InstitutionService.ListAuditEvents

  Audit log (Configuración › Auditoría), dirección only. Newest first, paged with the cursor of the last page

  `/ltedu.institution.v1.InstitutionService/ListAuditEvents` · unary · `ltedu/institution/v1/institution.proto`

  ## Request — `ListAuditEventsRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `module` | `string` | Optional filters; from / to are YYYY-MM-DD, to included |
  | `user_id` | `string` |  |
  | `from` | `string` |  |
  | `to` | `string` |  |
  | `before_at` | `string` | Cursor from the previous page (both or neither) |
  | `before_id` | `string` |  |
  | `limit` | `int32` |  |

  ## Response — `ListAuditEventsResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `events` | `repeated AuditEvent` |  |
  | `has_more` | `bool` |  |
  | `next_before_at` | `string` |  |
  | `next_before_id` | `string` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `AuditEvent`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `user_id` | `string` |  |
