  | `action` | `string` | create \| update \| delete \| status \| grant \| revoke \| other |
  | `entity` | `string` |  |
  | `entity_id` | `string` |  |
  | `summary` | `string` |  |
  | `changes_json` | `string` | Detail as JSON ({"field": [before, after]}), "{}" when none |
  | `created_at` | `string` | RFC 3339 |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
